    "text": "23 hours ago ALDI has announced the opening date for its second Bristol location!. The new grocery store will officially open its doors on October 29th at 1235 Farmington Avenue in Bristol; in the Bristol Farms plaza home to Hobby Lobby and Edge Fitness. ALDI will open for a 'Sneak Peek' day on October 28th for shoppers to experience the new store before its grand opening. Read full article",
